                                                "sense_id": "0611979c-e03d-3ae0-a086-f7897d426fe9",
                                                "text": "Calculating the growth in stepfamilies isn’t simple, but a demographic analysis published last year estimated that about 16 percent of Americans over age 70 have at least one stepchild. […] Overall, stepchildren provide less care to older adults"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
